Attribution
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This product includes review methodology, prompt text, and rubric content
adapted from open-code-review (ocr):

    https://github.com/alibaba/open-code-review
    Copyright the open-code-review (Alibaba) authors.
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Portions derived from open-code-review and MODIFIED in this project include:

  * the reviewer scope rules (the MAIN_TASK role/capabilities/scope discipline),
  * the "falsify, don't verify" review-comment filtering rule,
  * the default review checklist (Correctness, Security, Performance,
    Maintainability, Test Coverage) and the severity definitions,
  * the full-file scan, cross-batch dedup, and project-summary methodology,
  * the project rule-file shape used by examples/.ocr/rule.json.

Modifications made by this project include: re-expressing the methodology to run
natively inside Claude Code (an orchestrator skill fanning out per-file reviewer
subagents that read real files via native tools); adding an explicit
severity/confidence finding schema and a deterministic block/warn/pass verdict
parser; and removing the original "developed by Alibaba" self-identification,
which does not apply to this project.

This project is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by Alibaba or
Anthropic. It does not run the open-code-review binary and does not transmit any
authentication token to any third-party tool; all model inference is performed
by Claude Code itself.
